.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-info 1  "oct-info " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-info \- Show technical details about a card
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct info\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-card\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Show technical details about a card
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-card\fR \fI<card ident>\fR
Identifier of the card to use
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
